# What stays out of the published archive — and, by its last line, what
# comes back in. The repository's .gitignore excludes *.f3dshaders (built,
# tied to the Flutter SDK); a .pubignore replaces only its own directory's
# .gitignore, so the root's rule still applies from above and only the
# negation here wins the compiled material back. Build before publishing.
!*.f3dshaders
.dart_tool/
build/
